<metadata><name>Snowlands 1903 Hartley Springs and Peak 8925</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 9. 5.8 miles round trip to bowl above Hartley Springs and 6.4 miles round trip to Peak 8925. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/19/1903_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
